(text "Notes" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 689.61 294.132 0) (effects (font (size 2 2) (thickness 0.4) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "c3262fdf-dfd0-4787-8ce4-5807cc82fe93"))
(text "Bank TPS48100 VBAT_P -> VBAT_SLOTS: 5 mOhm + 61.9k = SCP 21.2/28.6/36.3 A, 68\nnF + 100k latch-off 466-1490 us (18.5x the slot latch). Hardware overload\ncutoff: INA281A2 -> 15.8k / 2x 10 uF -> TLV3012B -> 74LVC1G74 latch -> AO3400A\npulls U110 UVLO low; trip 3.15-3.76 A HOT (default; R773 10k holds P13 low at\nreset) or 5.11-6.08 A ROOM (TS5A3166 adds 25.5k, 0x22 P13); clear by toggling\nBANK_EN. U112 TS5A3166 is an 185 F (85 C) part: keep it >= 15 mm from\nR760/Q106/Q107/U110.\nEach slot: TPS48100 + 2x BSC070N10NS5 + 5 mOhm + 24.3k = SCP 10.6/13.5/16.6 A,\n1 nF C0G + 100k latch-off 8.0-20.9 us (+4.3 us). VS hold-up on all 9\ncontrollers (Pass 4): feed -> 1N4148W -> 100R -> VS, 1 uF / 100 V to GND\n(slots fed from VBAT_SLOTS, bank from VBAT_P): VS >= 4 V for >= 8 ms in a dead\nshort.\nGate network (bank + 8 slots): 470R G1PU; 0R G1PD (fitted); 2.2 nF C1 diode-\nsteered (1N4148W + 10R, 1M bleed to SRC); 1N4148W gate -> BST clamp; BZT52C15\nK = gate, A = source; C_BST 2.2 uF / 50 V. UVLO nodes 4.7 nF; 100 nF / 100 V\non VBAT_SLOTS and every SLn_VBAT. TPS2553 210k, FAULT wired-OR with FLT onto\nSLn_PWR_FAULT_N.\nPWR_EN = NOT EN_N AND NOT PRESENT_N (1G02); OUT_EN_N = NAND(PWR_EN,\nGLOBAL_OUT_ALLOW, NOT ARM_N) (1G04 + 1G10). +3V3_ID via 68R 1206. Math:\nMODULAR_ARCHITECTURE sections 15-16, docs/modular/pass3_calc.txt,\npass4_calc.txt." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 690.88 298.45 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3bdcbc91-f083-4156-825a-dd2a369950b9"))
